NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000111 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000112 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000113 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000114 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000115 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000116 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000117 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
